OL,6,G2245 Kane by Edson Burton
OL,7,     F1/5. A coming-of-age story by
OL,8,     FEdson Burton, set in an
OL,9,     Falternative version of
OL,10,     F21st-century Bristol, where
OL,11,     Fslavery has never been abolished
OL,12,     Fand a disturbing experiment is
OL,13,     Funder way.
OL,14,G2300 Galapagos
OL,15,     F4/5. Bryony is still happy to spin
OL,16,     Fthe narrative about the role of
OL,17,     Fthe Galapagos AI in Karikoga's
OL,18,     Fdeath. But she's about to realise
OL,19,     Fthat Galapagos' influence is now
OL,20,     Fmuch closer to home.
